				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1181,
				33
			],
			"Message": "build(Cocoon): regenerate build artifacts and update timestamp\n\nRegenerate all build artifacts in the `Target/` directory. The build artifacts include the main Cocoon bootstrap sequence and all the handlers. The timestamp has been updated to reflect the latest source adjustments in the extension host service layer. This commit captures binary output changes from source code adjustments, and ensures the Main. js bootstrap and all service representatives remain in sync with the most recent source state.",
			"SHA": "d988917b594b76ff7c43a85edb18733d08e416cd"
